{"seq":2,"slug":"microsegmentation","title":"微隔离与东西向流量治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation/microsegmentation","wordCount":1170,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"微隔离与东西向流量治理\">微隔离与东西向流量治理</h1><p>传统防火墙守护南北向流量（进出数据中心），但 80% 的攻击活动发生在东西向（服务间横向移动）。微隔离（Microsegmentation）将安全边界从网络边缘推进到每个工作负载，使每个服务只能与策略明确允许的对端通信。在零信任架构中，微隔离是&quot;假设已被突破&quot;原则的直接技术实现——即使攻击者控制了一个工作负载，也无法自由横向扩散。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微隔离可以在不同粒度实施，从粗到细：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离粒度</th>\n<th>实现层</th>\n<th>典型工具</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>环境隔离</td>\n<td>网络/VPC</td>\n<td>AWS Security Groups、Azure NSG</td>\n<td>开发/测试/生产环境分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用隔离</td>\n<td>子网/VLAN</td>\n<td>传统防火墙规则</td>\n<td>不同业务系统间隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务隔离</td>\n<td>L3/L4 网络策略</td>\n<td>Kubernetes NetworkPolicy、Calico</td>\n<td>同一集群内不同微服务间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进程隔离</td>\n<td>L7 应用层</td>\n<td>Cilium L7 Policy、Istio AuthZ</td>\n<td>同一服务不同 API 端点间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>生产建议</strong>：从环境隔离起步（成本最低、风险最小），逐步向服务隔离和进程隔离演进。不要试图一步到位——策略爆炸和误断生产流量的风险远大于收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kubernetes-原生网络策略\">Kubernetes 原生网络策略</h2><p>在 K8s 环境中，<code>NetworkPolicy</code> 是微隔离的基础原语。默认情况下 K8s 允许所有 Pod 间通信——这正是零信任要消除的隐式信任。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 默认拒绝所有入站流量（零信任起点）&#10;apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: NetworkPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: default-deny-ingress&#10;  namespace: production&#10;spec:&#10;  podSelector: {}&#10;  policyTypes:&#10;    - Ingress&#10;&#10;---&#10;# 仅允许 payment-api 接收来自 order-service 的流量&#10;apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: NetworkPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: allow-order-to-payment&#10;  namespace: production&#10;spec:&#10;  podSelector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: payment-api&#10;  ingress:&#10;    - from:&#10;        - podSelector:&#10;            matchLabels:&#10;              app: order-service&#10;      ports:&#10;        - port: 8080&#10;          protocol: TCP\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 默认拒绝所有入站流量（零信任起点）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NetworkPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default-deny-ingress</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policyTypes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Ingress</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅允许 payment-api 接收来自 order-service 的流量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NetworkPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">allow-order-to-payment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ingress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TCP</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键设计模式</strong>：先部署 <code>default-deny</code> 策略，再逐一白名单放行已知的合法流量。这是零信任&quot;默认拒绝&quot;原则在网络层的直接映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cilium-与-ebpf-驱动的-l7-策略\">Cilium 与 eBPF 驱动的 L7 策略</h2><p>传统 NetworkPolicy 仅支持 L3/L4（IP + Port）粒度。Cilium 基于 eBPF 在内核层实现了 L7 感知的微隔离——可以根据 HTTP 方法、路径、Header 做细粒度控制：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Node&#10;        POD_A[Pod: order-service]&#10;        POD_B[Pod: payment-api]&#10;        EBPF[eBPF 数据路径]&#10;        POLICY[Cilium Policy Engine]&#10;    end&#10;    POD_A --&gt;|HTTP POST /charge| EBPF&#10;    EBPF --&gt; POLICY&#10;    POLICY --&gt;|匹配 L7 规则: 允许| POD_B&#10;    POD_A --&gt;|HTTP DELETE /refund| EBPF&#10;    EBPF --&gt; POLICY&#10;    POLICY --&gt;|匹配 L7 规则: 拒绝| DROP[丢弃]\">graph TD\n    subgraph Node\n        POD_A[Pod: order-service]\n        POD_B[Pod: payment-api]\n        EBPF[eBPF 数据路径]\n        POLICY[Cilium Policy Engine]\n    end\n    POD_A --&gt;|HTTP POST /charge| EBPF\n    EBPF --&gt; POLICY\n    POLICY --&gt;|匹配 L7 规则: 允许| POD_B\n    POD_A --&gt;|HTTP DELETE /refund| EBPF\n    EBPF --&gt; POLICY\n    POLICY --&gt;|匹配 L7 规则: 拒绝| DROP[丢弃]</pre><p>Cilium L7 策略示例——仅允许 order-service 调用 payment-api 的 POST 方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: cilium.io/v2&#10;kind: CiliumNetworkPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: payment-l7-policy&#10;spec:&#10;  endpointSelector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: payment-api&#10;  ingress:&#10;    - fromEndpoints:&#10;        - matchLabels:&#10;            app: order-service&#10;      toPorts:&#10;        - ports:&#10;            - port: &#39;8080&#39;&#10;              protocol: TCP&#10;          rules:&#10;            http:&#10;              - method: POST&#10;                path: &#39;/v1/charges&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cilium.io/v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CiliumNetworkPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-l7-policy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  endpointSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ingress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fromEndpoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      toPorts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'8080'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TCP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">POST</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/v1/charges'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"基于身份的微隔离-spiffe-mtls\">基于身份的微隔离（SPIFFE + mTLS）</h2><p>IP 地址在云原生环境中不是稳定标识——Pod 重启后 IP 改变，Serverless 函数没有固定地址。基于身份的微隔离使用工作负载身份（SPIFFE ID）替代 IP 作为策略选择器：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个工作负载持有 SPIFFE SVID（X.509 证书），包含其身份标识</li>\n<li>通信双方通过 mTLS 握手验证对方身份</li>\n<li>策略引擎基于 SPIFFE ID（而非 IP）做访问决策</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这与传统基于 IP 的微隔离相比的核心优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>基于 IP</th>\n<th>基于身份 (SPIFFE)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pod 漂移</td>\n<td>需要同步更新策略</td>\n<td>身份不变，策略无需更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多集群</td>\n<td>IP 冲突需要复杂 NAT</td>\n<td>身份全局唯一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仿冒攻击</td>\n<td>IP 可被 ARP 欺骗</td>\n<td>证书不可伪造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略可读性</td>\n<td><code>allow 10.0.3.45</code></td>\n<td><code>allow spiffe://prod/payments</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流量可视化与策略发现\">流量可视化与策略发现</h2><p>在已有大量微服务的环境中，从零开始手写微隔离策略几乎不可能——你不知道哪些服务在和谁通信。正确的路径是<strong>先观察，再隔离</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>流量采集</strong>：部署 Hubble（Cilium 配套）或 Istio Kiali 采集所有服务间调用关系</li>\n<li><strong>依赖图生成</strong>：自动生成服务依赖拓扑图，标注通信频率和协议</li>\n<li><strong>策略建议</strong>：基于观察到的合法流量自动生成 NetworkPolicy 草案</li>\n<li><strong>渐进执行</strong>：先以审计模式（Audit）部署策略，标记被阻断的流量但不实际拒绝</li>\n<li><strong>逐步收紧</strong>：确认无误后切换为强制模式（Enforce）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"微隔离的反模式\">微隔离的反模式</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>过度细分</strong>：为每个 API 端点创建独立策略 → 策略爆炸、运维不可持续</li>\n<li><strong>仅依赖 L3/L4</strong>：不区分同一端口上的不同操作 → 安全粒度不足</li>\n<li><strong>忽略出站（Egress）</strong>：只管入站流量 → 被控工作负载仍可向外渗出数据</li>\n<li><strong>策略与部署脱钩</strong>：策略变更不走 CI/CD → 配置漂移、审计困难</li>\n<li><strong>无监控的强制模式</strong>：直接上 Enforce 无观察期 → 断裂生产流量</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>微隔离将安全边界推进到工作负载级别，直接实现&quot;假设已被突破&quot;原则</li>\n<li>从 <code>default-deny</code> 起步，逐步白名单放行是零信任网络策略的标准模式</li>\n<li>Cilium/eBPF 实现 L7 感知策略，突破传统 NetworkPolicy 的 L3/L4 限制</li>\n<li>SPIFFE 身份替代 IP 地址，解决云原生环境中地址不稳定的问题</li>\n<li>&quot;先观察再隔离&quot;的渐进路径避免策略爆炸与生产中断</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"identity-centric-access\">身份中心访问控制</a>——微隔离所依赖的工作负载身份体系（SPIFFE/SPIRE）</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../service-mesh/foundations/data-plane-architecture\">服务网格数据面架构</a>——Service Mesh 如何在 Sidecar/eBPF 层实现 mTLS 与流量拦截</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"微隔离与东西向流量治理","id":"微隔离与东西向流量治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Kubernetes 原生网络策略","id":"kubernetes-原生网络策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Cilium 与 eBPF 驱动的 L7 策略","id":"cilium-与-ebpf-驱动的-l7-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"基于身份的微隔离（SPIFFE + mTLS）","id":"基于身份的微隔离-spiffe-mtls"},{"level":2,"text":"流量可视化与策略发现","id":"流量可视化与策略发现"},{"level":2,"text":"微隔离的反模式","id":"微隔离的反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"身份中心访问控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation/identity-centric-access"},"next":{"title":"设备信任与端点合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation/device-trust"}}